Year = {2018},
Volume = {35},
Number = {1},
Pages = {132-150},
Month = {JAN-APR},
Abstract = {Environmental Education is a subject that interferes directly in our
   daily. It makes possible the reflections and discussions so that this
   knowledge contributes to the change in the behavior of individuals in
   their relationship with the Environment. This study presents a
   discussion about the application of a Didactic Sequence on the Garbage
   Ecological Footprint to promote of Environmental Education. We aimed to
   identify and analyze the development of the critical sense of a 6th
   grade elementary students class in Curitiba-PR. It was observed in the
   application of the Didactic Sequence an interaction and inter-relation
   of learning conducted to approach the theory to the practice,
   manifesting the critical thinking of the students. We observed that
   since the development of integrated and participative actions improves
   the discussions that emerge from the relationships between beings human,
   society and nature.},
